                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>Our employees’ hard work and dedication is what delivers success. Our talent philosophy is simple. It connects each person’s individual&amp;nbsp;success to the success they help create for our company.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>AbbVie’s approach to benefits, compensation and well-being—what we call Total Rewards—is designed&amp;nbsp;to be competitive. In addition to recognising and rewarding individual performance, we also offer employees flexibility and support throughout their changing life stages.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
