                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>Vitality is our approach to employee well-being. It’s about sustaining healthy behaviours&amp;nbsp;so that each person performs their best both inside and outside the workplace. AbbVie Vitality encompasses a wide range of events, programmes and resources, including:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Education on health-related topics like stress management, nutrition, safety, and work/life balance through seminars and online resources&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Health promotion&amp;nbsp;programmes on topics such as diabetes, cancer and weight management&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>On-site screenings and immunisations to promote disease awareness and early detection&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Sports clubs such as running, football, tag rugby and exercise classes, including TRX&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Health fairs, fitness events and team exercise challenges&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
