                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>We are always looking for talented people to join our team. When we find them, we make it our business to treat them well. Because every country is different, our benefits vary by country.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Some examples of what we offer in Ireland include:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Incentive and recognition programmes&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Healthcare benefits&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Retirement benefits&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Life and disability insurance&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Sick pay and medical leave&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Paid vacation and holidays&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Employee Assistance Programme&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Access to a range of benefits via our Flexible Benefits platform&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Flexibility at work&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Family-friendly policies&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
